# MemLore project context for Spec Kit

- Core (target): Go 1.25+ — `cmd/`, `internal/`, `migrations/`, `db/queries/` (ADR 0005)
- Graph service: Python 3.12 — `graph-service/` (thin Graphiti boundary)
- Tests: `go test ./...` for core; pytest in `graph-service/`
- Governance DB: PostgreSQL; Knowledge: Graphiti + Neo4j; async sync via outbox
- Adapters: REST + MCP (`memlore.*`) + CLI (`memlore`) — Go
- Tooling: go test/vet, goose, sqlc, Docker Compose; uv/ruff/mypy in graph-service
- Constitution: `.specify/memory/constitution.md` (v1.2.0)
- Brand: MemLore per ADR 0004

